{"D:\\wt\\lou8\\vlog\\lou8\\voz\\b012_t6.wav": {"text": "And slowly, a whole generation forgot that pancakes are five things in a bowl. My mother never bought a box in her life. She'd have laughed at it. I'll tell you one more thing. On the last Sunday before I closed my diner, I made the batter Saturday night like always. 212 pancakes that morning. The last plate went to an old trucker who'd been coming in for 30 years. He ate the whole stack, wiped his mouth, and said, Lou, I never once had a bad pancake here. That's all a cook ever wants to hear. And one more thing about that trucker. A few weeks after I closed, a card came in the mail. No return address. Inside was a napkin from my diner, folded in four, and on it, in pencil, somebody had written my batter recipe from memory. two cups of flour two spoons of sugar the baking powder the pinch of salt the egg the milk the butter every number right", "words": [{"w": " And", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.24}, {"w": " slowly,", "s": 0.24, "e": 0.74}, {"w": " a", "s": 0.74, "e": 1.32}, {"w": " whole", "s": 1.32, "e": 1.7}, {"w": " generation", "s": 1.7, "e": 2.38}, {"w": " forgot", "s": 2.38, "e": 2.84}, {"w": " that", "s": 2.84, "e": 3.28}, {"w": " pancakes", "s": 3.28, "e": 3.8}, {"w": " are", "s": 3.8, "e": 4.12}, {"w": " five", "s": 4.12, "e": 4.5}, {"w": " things", "s": 4.5, "e": 4.88}, {"w": " in", "s": 4.88, "e": 5.1}, {"w": " a", "s": 5.1, "e": 5.22}, {"w": " bowl.", "s": 5.22, "e": 6.02}, {"w": " My", "s": 6.36, "e": 6.56}, {"w": " mother", "s": 6.56, "e": 6.92}, {"w": " never", "s": 6.92, "e": 7.36}, {"w": " bought", "s": 7.36, "e": 7.62}, {"w": " a", "s": 7.62, "e": 7.78}, {"w": " box", "s": 7.78, "e": 8.1}, {"w": " in", "s": 8.1, "e": 8.28}, {"w": " her", "s": 8.28, "e": 8.42}, {"w": " life.", "s": 8.42, "e": 9.32}, {"w": " She'd", "s": 9.32, "e": 9.58}, {"w": " have", "s": 9.58, "e": 9.68}, {"w": " laughed", "s": 9.68, "e": 10.08}, {"w": " at", "s": 10.08, "e": 10.32}, {"w": " it.", "s": 10.32, "e": 10.52}, {"w": " I'l